{"_id":"68a7360a8ec3d8323af114bc","nodeId":"kGnKzCkQCNFEdgCBRtNuW","roadmapSlug":"angular","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:50.309Z","description":"# Angular Components\n\nComponents are the main building block for Angular applications. Each component consists of:\n\n*   An HTML template that declares what renders on the page\n*   A TypeScript class that defines the behavior\n*   A CSS selector that defines how the component is used in a template\n*   Optionally, CSS styles applied to the template","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Anatomy of a Component","url":"https://angular.dev/guide/components","_id":"6a7f49d1cb44947debcf0e14"},{"type":"official","title":"Composing with Components in Angular","url":"https://angular.dev/essentials/components","_id":"6a7f49d1cb44947debcf0e15"},{"type":"video","title":"Standalone Components in Angular","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x5PZwb4XurU","_id":"6a7f49d1cb44947debcf0e16"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about Angular","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/angular?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a7f49d1cb44947debcf0e17"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:01:05.151Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/angular/content/kGnKzCkQCNFEdgCBRtNuW.md"}